     \"errorMessage\": \"429 {\\\"type\\\":\\\"error\\\",\\\"error\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"rate_limit_error\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"usage limit exceeded (2056)\\\"},\\\"request_id\\\":\\\"061a34fff217a70ef37716d4332e15ed\\\"}\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"8902095f\",\n            \"seq\": 463\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:subagent:1b236d4c-9ce9-485c-aa45-36ce05fb10fd\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"label\": \"openclaw-p1-cron-model-override\",\n      \"displayName\": \"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-1b236d4c-9ce9-485c-aa45-36ce05fb10fd\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n        \"to\": \"heartbeat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774909382130,\n      \"sessionId\": \"acd7e0e1-5370-445c-933d-46503b2b5eb2\",\n      \"model\": \"openrouter/free\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 126623,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1774906215392,\n      \"endedAt\": 1774909007620,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 941318,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"heartbeat\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/acd7e0e1-5370-445c-933d-46503b2b5eb2.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"太好了！所有测试都通过了。现在让我总结修复结果并回报给main。\\n\\n修复总结：\\n1. **问题定位**：在`src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts`中，当payload model被`resolveAllowedModelRef`拒绝时（例如：model不在catalog/allowlist中），代码会提前返回默认模型，而没有继续尝试fallback链（subagents model → session model override → agent default）\\n\\n2. **修复方案**：移除了当错误是\\\"model not allowed\\\"时的提前返回，允许代码继续到session model override的fallback逻辑\\n\\n3. **测试结果**：所有cron model override相关测试都通过了\\n\\n4. **Git diff**：修复了`model-selection.ts`文件，允许payload model被拒绝时能正确fallback\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"**修复完成！✅**\\n\\n## 状态：成功\\n\\n## 任务：修复 OpenClaw S 级 regression #57947 - Cron payload model override 被忽略\\n\\n## 结果：\\n\\n### 问题定位\\n在 `src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts` 文件中，当 cron job 的 `payload.model` 被 `resolveAllowedModelRef` 拒绝时（例如：model 不在 catalog/allowlist 中），代码会提前返回默认模型，而没有继续尝试 fallback 链。\\n\\n**原有代码（有bug）**：\\n```typescript\\nif (\\\"error\\\" in resolvedOverride) {\\n  if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\\\"model not allowed:\\\")) {\\n    return {\\n      ok: true,\\n      provider,  // ← 返回默认模型，不尝试fallback!\\n      model,\\n      warning: `cron: payload.model '${modelOverride}' not allowed, falling back to agent defaults`,\\n    };\\n  }\\n  return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 修复方案\\n移除当错误是 \\\"model not allowed\\\" 时的提前返回，允许代码继续到 session model override 的 fallback 逻辑，实现完整的模型选择优先级链：\\n\\n1. Job payload override (最高优先级)\\n2. Hook-specific defaults\\n3. Agent config default (subagents.model)\\n4. **Session model override** ← 修复后，payload model 被拒绝时会尝试这个\\n\\n**修复后代码**：\\n```typescript\\nif (\\\"error\\\" in resolvedOverride) {\\n  if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\\\"model not allowed:\\\")) {\\n    // 不提前返回 - 允许 fallback 到 session model override\\n  } else {\\n    return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\\n  }\\n} else {\\n  provider = resolvedOverride.ref.provider;\\n  model = resolvedOverride.ref.model;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Git Diff\\n\\n```diff\\n--- a/src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts\\n+++ b/src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts\\n@@ -101,15 +101,12 @@   }\\n \\n     if (\\\"error\\\" in resolvedOverride) {\\n-      if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\\\"model not allowed:\\\")) {\\n-        return {\\n-          ok: true,\\n-          provider,\\n-          model,\\n-          warning: `cron: payload.model '${modelOverride}' not allowed, falling back to agent defaults`,\\n-        };\\n-      }\\n-      return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\\n+      if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\\\"model not allowed:\\\")) {\\n+        // Don't early return - allow fallback to session model override\\n+      } else {\\n+        return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\\n+      }\\n     } else {\\n       provider = resolvedOverride.ref.provider;\\n       model = resolvedOverride.ref.model;\\n```\\n\\n### 测试结果\\n\\n所有 cron model override 相关测试均通过：\\n\\n```\\n✓ src/cron/isolated-agent/run.cron-model-override.test.ts\\n  ✓ persists cron payload model on session entry even when run throws (101ms)\\n  ✓ session entry already carries cron model at pre-run persist time (race condition) (14ms)\\n  ✓ returns error without persisting model when payload model is disallowed (5ms)\\n  ✓ persists session-level /model override on session entry before run (3ms)\\n  ✓ logs warning and continues when pre-run persist fails (16ms)\\n  ✓ persists default model pre-run when no payload override is present (9ms)\\n\\nTest Files: 1 passed\\nTests: 6 passed\\n```\\n\\n### 预期说明\\n\\n这个修复确保了当用户的 cron payload model 不可用时（例如：不在 model catalog 中），系统会正确地回退到 session-level model override，而不是直接回退到 agent default model。这修复了 # 57947 中描述的 \\\"payload.model 被完全忽略，总是使用 agent default\\\" 的回归问题。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"arkcode\",\n          \"model\": \"glm-4.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 114628,\n            \"output\": 983,\n            \"totalTokens\": 115611,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774908940894,\n          \"responseId\": \"021774908942080dae410d06a911c4f7bd0a80e7e433f8a25f76f\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"eed46a35\",\n            \"seq\": 401\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"count":10,"sessions":[{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774922883011,"sessionId":"51db78ba-60de-4bc2-bf39-4201e78fea38","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":69438,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774922714945,"childSessions":["agent:main:subagent:93c873bf-167e-43ef-8013-a616f9762715","agent:main:subagent:649ba9b6-a90f-4fcf-8ebf-91bf9a54c2af","agent:main:subagent:56b02275-ebfd-444b-9a70-3cf3792b9191","agent:main:subagent:bf4288e7-71c3-43bb-b3c8-6c3e6cf81173"],"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/51db78ba-60de-4bc2-bf39-4201e78fea38.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! xixi delivered the scan. Now I need to:\n1. Take the top candidates and forward them to aoao for action\n2. Support the PRs that are ready to support\n\nBut first, let me check the aoao session status to see if it's alive and if sessions_send still works.\n\nActually, the main issue is that sessions_send to aoao has been timing out. Let me check the current aoao session state and try to send it tasks.\n\nFrom the log, aoao had sessions_send timeouts at:\n- 2026-03-31 03:43 (first timeout)\n- 2026-03-31 06:25 (second timeout)\n\n\n- 2026-03-31 06:25 (third timeout)\n\nSo the core problem is that aoao's deliveryContext.channel is configured for webchat but it should be feishu. Let me check the current status of the aoao session and attempt to send it the new tasks from this scan round."},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 第25轮扫描完成，发现 #58058（Feishu sync regression）和 #58041（auto-update crash loop）是最高优先级。先查一下 aoao 的 session 状态，看 sessions_send 超时问题是否还在。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d6v6da9vdjo0_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["subagent"],"limit":10,"messageLimit":2}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":47722,"output":307,"totalTokens":69745,"cacheRead":21716,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774922880896,"responseId":"061a5f815184f8911ac1cdbc213fab01","__openclaw":{"id":"5f8a09dc","seq":10}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774922882542,"sessionId":"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":116618,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774680292047,"endedAt":1774680429813,"runtimeMs":137766,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I have enough to compile a comprehensive report. Let me look at the key findings:\n\n**Top regression/P1 issues from this scan:**\n\n1. **#58058** - `Real-time message and task status sync failure between local dashboard and Feishu/Telegram` - bug + regression - P1 - 2026.3.28 - Feishu/Telegram dashboard sync broken\n2. **#58052** - `Slack channel never initialises on v2026.3.28` - P1 - 2026.3.28 - Slack channel absent from status\n\n\n3. **#58041** - `Auto-update is not atomic: config/plugin version mismatch causes repeated crash loops` - P1 - multiple versions, causes 3 separate overnight outages\n4. **#58046** - `Foundry plugin enters infinite reload loop, crashes gateway` - P2\n\nI'm also tracking some key PRs that could help address these issues, including a fix for the primary probe slot consumption problem that's marked as size S with no reviews yet.\n\nThe Feishu regression stands out as particularly critical since it's affecting our own infrastructure, while the auto-update crash loops represent a serious operational issue for anyone running automated deployments."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n**状态：成功**\n\n**第25轮扫描结论（2026-03-31 10:06 北京时间 / 02:06 UTC）**\n\n---\n\n**新发现列表（含本次新增）：**\n\n| # | 标题 | 标签 | 优先级 | 版本 |\n|---|------|------|--------|------|\n| 58058 | Real-time message and task status sync failure between local dashboard and Feishu/Telegram | bug + regression | **P1** | 2026.3.28 |\n| 58052 | Slack channel never initialises on v2026.3.28 — channel absent from status | regression | **P1** | 2026.3.28 |\n| 58041 | Auto-update is not atomic: config/plugin version mismatch causes repeated crash loops | regression | **P1** | 跨多版本 |\n| 58059 | OpenRouter model context window not auto-detected from provider catalog | bug:behavior | P2 | — |\n| 58055 | QMD backend returns empty `memory_search` results while CLI search works | bug + bug:behavior | P2 | 2026.3.28 |\n| 58046 | Foundry plugin enters infinite reload loop, crashes gateway | bug:crash | P2 | 2026.3.24 |\n| 58054 | fix: surface actual error instead of misleading pinned write message | size:XS, 1review | 可支持 | — |\n| 58051 | fix: primary probe should not consume transient probe slot for same-provider fallbacks | size:S, 0review | 可支持 | — |\n| 58050 | fix(memory): expand tilde in extraMemoryPaths before path resolution | size:XS, 1review | 可支持 | — |\n\n---\n\n**最高优先级 3 个建议：**\n\n**#1 — #58058（Feishu 相关 regression，P1）**\n`Real-time message and task status sync failure between local dashboard and Feishu/Telegram`\n- 刚开 2 小时，证据链中等（无 logs，但描述清晰，2026.3.28 regression）\n- 影响：Feishu/Telegram 与 dashboard 之间的实时同步完全破坏\n- 可修性：S（需要确认是 webhook/polling 路径断连，还是 session state 同步问题）\n- **建议：立即向 maintainer 确认是否已有 hotfix；aoao 可同步准备调研 Feishu channel 的 status sync 逻辑**\n\n**#2 — #58052（Slack regression，P1）**\n`Slack channel never initialises on v2026.3.28 — no socket connection, channel absent from status`\n- 2026.3.28 regression；channels table 完全为空，无 Slack 日志条目\n- 注意：与 #58053 PR add dingtalk（XL）几乎同时间提交，怀疑某个 Socket Mode 相关改动破坏了 Slack init\n- 可修性：S（根因可能在 channel init 顺序或 socket mode adapter 加载）\n- **建议：review 最近涉及 Socket Mode 的 commit；PR #56677/56687 的改动是否影响了 Slack**\n\n**#3 — #58041（Auto-update crash loop，P1）**\n`Auto-update is not atomic: config/plugin version mismatch causes repeated crash loops`\n- 6 天内 3 次夜间宕机，跨 v2026.3.13 → v2026.3.28 多版本\n- 根因已定位：auto-update 非原子，config/plugin manifest 更新后 binary 仍为旧版，导致 gateway 无法启动后无限 crash loop\n- 可修性：S（修复方案清晰：确保 update 原子性，或在启动时加版本一致性检查）\n- **建议：aoao 可接，这个是确定的 regression 但 hotfix 路径清晰**\n\n---\n\n**可立即支持的 PR：**\n- **#58051**（S，0 review）：probe slot 问题，影响 fallback 链；review 后可直接 approve\n- **#58054**（XS，1 review）：修复误导性错误信息，review 后可直接支持\n\n---\n\n**扫描结论：**\n本轮最大发现是 **2026.3.28 同时引入了至少 2 个 regression**（Feishu/Telegram sync + Slack init），建议优先向 maintainer 确认 hotfix 状态。同时 #58041 是长期痛的 regression，可主动认领。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100989,"output":1164,"totalTokens":117782,"cacheRead":15629,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774922842646,"responseId":"061a5f5a93542d1c97312529230c8a3d","__openclaw":{"id":"2e397cb0","seq":315}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774922637361,"sessionId":"16b859d4-1a91-40c7-838a-dcb91a6d4974","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":141438,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","started