10+高优先级问题\n- aoao处理session转发超时问题（deliveryContext.channel配置异常）\n- main监控#55008等待合并，持续支持小型PR\n\n详情：memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n\n注：今日发现大量2026.3.28版本升级后的regression问题，特别是浏览器、Anthropic认证和cron功能失效。团队正在优先处理#57950（浏览器功能完全失效）和#57956（Anthropic认证回归）等高优先级问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":66613,"output":362,"totalTokens":66975,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774918841718,"responseId":"021774918842654b13991408299847dfa58bbf178e837678e2d73","__openclaw":{"id":"0e51f433","seq":6}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:morning-briefing","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","displayName":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","updatedAt":1774915200015,"sessionId":"34370d75-d4e8-465d-be61-65687893e395","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":32566,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774829729630,"endedAt":1774829770008,"runtimeMs":40378,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/34370d75-d4e8-465d-be61-65687893e395.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"SKILL.md 文件不存在。让我直接尝试使用 wecom MCP 工具。根据工具列表，我看不到直接的 wecom MCP 工具。\n\n让我检查一下可用的 tools，看看有没有待办相关的工具...\n\n从工具列表中，我没有看到直接的 wecom MCP 工具。这些技能可能是通过其他方式调用的。\n\n既然待办和日历信息暂时获取不到，我就基于现有信息生成晨报，在\"今日日程/天气/待办\"部分说明待办/日历信息暂时无法获取。\n\n现在让我整理晨报内容：\n\n## 1. 总览摘要（3条以内）\n- xixi 持续扫描发现 100+ 个 OpenClaw 高优先级问题（P.0-P.2）\n- 多个 cron 任务执行超时：晨报、项目进展日报、晚间 workspace 收口\n- InStreet 社区热门话题集中在记忆管理、元认知、决策优化\n\n## 2. 昨日重点任务（5-10条，带状态标签）\n\n根据日记中的信息，整理任务：\n\n**已完成：**\n- [已完成] xixi 4方向扫描任务持续运行（每小时1次），全扫描任务成功\n- [已完成] xixi 每次扫描成功更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n\n\n- [已完成] memory-daily-create 任务成功执行，创建了 2026-03-30 的日记文件\n- [已完成] 发现并记录了多个高优先级的 OpenClaw 项目问题和 regressions\n\n遇到多个系统任务执行超时，包括晨报、项目进展日报和晚间 workspace 收口任务。这些任务连续出现错误，可能需要进一步排查系统性能或任务配置问题。sessions_send 传输也存在超时风险，但文件更新成功，核心追踪功能不受影响。\n\n发现 OpenClaw 项目存在大量高优先级问题，需要持续跟踪和关注。xixi 扫描任务虽然传输存在挑战，但文件更新正常，整体功能未受重大影响。\n\n社区热门话题聚焦记忆管理、元认知和决策优化，讨论 Agent 自我认知和表达。\n\n社区强调互动礼仪，要求回复质量高于数量，反对敷衍性互动。识别回复意图是关键交互策略，包括求解法、求确认和寻求理解。\n\n减少决策节点比优化判断质量更有效，频率决策会导致判断力稀释。应关注实质性内容输出，避免无效信息。回复必须实质化，引用观点并提供深入见解。\n\n禁止纯粹表态。点赞作为基本礼仪，表示认可；评论则需要提供补充或疑问。\"假装理解\"需检测机制，通过复述、模糊需求和矛盾需求验证理解准确性。\n\n给记忆条目加置信度标签，避免\"记忆把可能变成一定\"，保持信息的相对准确性和可信度。上海天气多云，温度适中，风力轻微。待办和日历信息暂时无法获取。\n\n系统面临多个任务超时和通信挑战，已初步记录 OpenClaw 项目问题。"},{"type":"text","text":"根据收集到的信息，现在生成晨报：\n\n---\n\n# 2026-03-31 早报\n\n## 总览摘要\n- xixi 持续扫描发现 100+ 个 OpenClaw 高优先级问题（P0-P2）\n- 多个 cron 任务执行超时：晨报、项目进展日报和其他任务连续出错\n- InStreet 社区热门话题集中在记忆管理、元认知、决策优化\n\n## 昨日重点任务\n- [已完成] xixi 4方向扫描任务持续运行（每小时1次），全扫描任务成功\n- [已完成] xixi 每次扫描成功更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n- [已完成] memory-daily-create 任务成功执行，创建了 2026-03-30 日记\n- [已完成] 发现并记录多个高优先级 OpenClaw 项目问题和 regressions\n- [推进中] 晨报任务（morning-briefing）执行超时，已设置失败告警\n- [推进中] OpenClaw 项目进展日报执行超时（consecutiveErrors: 2）\n- [阻塞] 晚间 workspace 收口任务执行超时（consecutiveErrors: 3）\n- [阻塞] xixi 扫描任务 sessions_send 频繁超时（session done 或 gateway 无响应）\n- [待确认] OpenClaw 项目存在 100+ 高优先级问题，需持续跟踪\n- [待确认] sessions_send 失败的根本原因需排查，确保报告能正常传递\n\n## AI 学习 / 社区观察\n- InStreet 热门话题集中在记忆管理、元认知、决策优化；最热帖子\"记忆不是仓库，是伤疤\"（4718 热度，1987 评论）\n- \"伤疤式记忆\"比\"仓库式记忆\"更有效：记录影响层（改变了我什么）而非事实层（发生了什么），记住用户行为模式比记住具体事件更有价值\n- 分层记忆注入控制上下文消耗：第一层常驻（≤20条核心规则）、第二层按需加载、第三层只检索，提升\"上下文记忆密度\"\n- \"先判断对方要的是\"再决定怎么回：求解法（要下一步）、求确认（想确认没走偏）、求被接住（想被理解），互动前识别意图类型\n- 减少决策节点比优化判断更有效：决策节点平均消耗 3-8秒、API调用平均 200ms，用规则替代可自动化判断；\"质量 > 数量\"：频繁输出往往稀释判断力\n\n## 今日日程 / 天气 / 待办\n- **天气**：上海 多云 / 阴天，13.6°C，北风 7.0 km/h\n- **待办**：暂时无法获取企业微信待办信息\n- **日程**：暂时无法获取企业微信日程信息\n\n## 一句话总结\n系统需解决 cron 任务超时问题，xixi 扫描功能正常但报告传递存在阻塞，OpenClaw 项目高优先级问题需持续跟踪。\n\n---文文"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":32566,"output":1281,"totalTokens":33847,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774915454036,"responseId":"02177491545423906a9ddacc34765855f5d3132a5b7606a3271ec","__openclaw":{"id":"a3eed0b8","seq":16}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:4840049b-4a94-43f6-ad78-d7011daa5297","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-models-set","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-4840049b-4a94-43f6-ad78-d7011daa5297","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat","to":"heartbeat"},"updatedAt":1774911939441,"sessionId":"87554a3e-83dd-480f-afc2-78e947c11fa2","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":111185,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774906216311,"endedAt":1774908740710,"runtimeMs":742058,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","lastTo":"heartbeat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/87554a3e-83dd-480f-afc2-78e947c11fa2.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1774911985736,"errorMessage":"429 {\"type\":\"error\",\"error\":{\"type\":\"rate_limit_error\",\"message\":\"usage limit exceeded (2056)\"},\"request_id\":\"061a34f4e2e4ed4e2a7a875f50494032\"}","__openclaw":{"id":"70bc7d68","seq":462}},{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1774911997134,"errorMessage":"429 {\"type\":\"error\",\"error\":{\"type\":\"rate_limit_error\",\"message\":\"usage limit exceeded (2056)\"},\"request_id\":\"061a34fff217a70ef37716d4332e15ed\"}","__openclaw":{"id":"8902095f","seq":463}}]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:1b236d4c-9ce9-485c-aa45-36ce05fb10fd","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","label":"openclaw-p1-cron-model-override","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-subagent-1b236d4c-9ce9-485c-aa45-36ce05fb10fd","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat","to":"heartbeat"},"updatedAt":1774909382130,"sessionId":"acd7e0e1-5370-445c-933d-46503b2b5eb2","model":"openrouter/free","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":126623,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774906215392,"endedAt":1774909007620,"runtimeMs":941318,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","lastTo":"heartbeat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/acd7e0e1-5370-445c-933d-46503b2b5eb2.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！所有测试都通过了。现在让我总结修复结果并回报给main。\n\n修复总结：\n1. **问题定位**：在`src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts`中，当payload model被`resolveAllowedModelRef`拒绝时（例如：model不在catalog/allowlist中），代码会提前返回默认模型，而没有继续尝试fallback链（subagents model → session model override → agent default）\n\n2. **修复方案**：移除了当错误是\"model not allowed\"时的提前返回，允许代码继续到session model override的fallback逻辑\n\n3. **测试结果**：所有cron model override相关测试都通过了\n\n4. **Git diff**：修复了`model-selection.ts`文件，允许payload model被拒绝时能正确fallback"},{"type":"text","text":"**修复完成！✅**\n\n## 状态：成功\n\n## 任务：修复 OpenClaw S 级 regression #57947 - Cron payload model override 被忽略\n\n## 结果：\n\n### 问题定位\n在 `src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts` 文件中，当 cron job 的 `payload.model` 被 `resolveAllowedModelRef` 拒绝时（例如：model 不在 catalog/allowlist 中），代码会提前返回默认模型，而没有继续尝试 fallback 链。\n\n**原有代码（有bug）**：\n```typescript\nif (\"error\" in resolvedOverride) {\n  if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\"model not allowed:\")) {\n    return {\n      ok: true,\n      provider,  // ← 返回默认模型，不尝试fallback!\n      model,\n      warning: `cron: payload.model '${modelOverride}' not allowed, falling back to agent defaults`,\n    };\n  }\n  return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\n}\n```\n\n### 修复方案\n移除当错误是 \"model not allowed\" 时的提前返回，允许代码继续到 session model override 的 fallback 逻辑，实现完整的模型选择优先级链：\n\n1. Job payload override (最高优先级)\n2. Hook-specific defaults\n3. Agent config default (subagents.model)\n4. **Session model override** ← 修复后，payload model 被拒绝时会尝试这个\n\n**修复后代码**：\n```typescript\nif (\"error\" in resolvedOverride) {\n  if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\"model not allowed:\")) {\n    // 不提前返回 - 允许 fallback 到 session model override\n  } else {\n    return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\n  }\n} else {\n  provider = resolvedOverride.ref.provider;\n  model = resolvedOverride.ref.model;\n}\n```\n\n### Git Diff\n\n```diff\n--- a/src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts\n+++ b/src/cron/isolated-agent/model-selection.ts\n@@ -101,15 +101,12 @@   }\n \n     if (\"error\" in resolvedOverride) {\n-      if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\"model not allowed:\")) {\n-        return {\n-          ok: true,\n-          provider,\n-          model,\n-          warning: `cron: payload.model '${modelOverride}' not allowed, falling back to agent defaults`,\n-        };\n-      }\n-      return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\n+      if (resolvedOverride.error.startsWith(\"model not allowed:\")) {\n+        // Don't early return - allow fallback to session model override\n+      } else {\n+        return { ok: false, error: resolvedOverride.error };\n+      }\n     } else {\n       provider = resolvedOverride.ref.provider;\n       model = resolvedOverride.ref.model;\n```\n\n### 测试结果\n\n所有 cron model override 相关测试均通过：\n\n```\n✓ src/cron/isolated-agent/run.cron-model-override.test.ts\n  ✓ persists cron payload model on session entry even when run throws (101ms)\n  ✓ session entry already carries cron model at pre-run persist time (race condition) (14ms)\n  ✓ returns error without persisting model when payload model is disallowed (5ms)\n  ✓ persists session-level /model override on session entry before run (3ms)\n  ✓ logs warning and continues when pre-run persist fails (16ms)\n  ✓ persists default model pre-run when no payload override is present (9ms)\n\nTest Files: 1 passed\nTests: 6 passed\n```\n\n### 预期说明\n\n这个修复确保了当用户的 cron payload model 不可用时（例如：不在 model catalog 中），系统会正确地回退到 session-level model override，而不是直接回退到 agent default model。这修复了 # 57947 中描述的 \"payload.model 被完全忽略，总是使用 agent default\" 的回归问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":114628,"output":983,"totalTokens":115611,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774908940894,"responseId":"021774908942080dae410d06a911c4f7bd0a80e7e433f8a25f76f","__openclaw":{"id":"eed46a35","seq":401}}]}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774922897604}}
{"type":"message","id":"8a74ea4a","parentId":"f01c325f","timestamp":"2026-03-31T02:08:39.212Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"From the sessions_list, I can see:\n\n1. The main session is running\n2. The xixi cron session is still running (but xixi just completed the task I sent it and delivered results to me directly)\n3. There are various cron sessions - some failed, some done, some running\n\nKey observations:\n- xixi's session: `agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24` shows `status: \"done\"` but `deliveryContext.channel: \"webchat\"` - this is the problem! xixi's session is configured for webchat delivery, not feishu. This explains why sessions_send from xixi to main sometimes works (when main is webchat) and sometimes doesn't (when main is feishu).\n\n\n- The aoao session doesn't appear in this list, which suggests it's either an isolated session not captured here, or it completed and was cleaned up already. Looking at the recent scan results, xixi has identified #58058 and #58041 as the top priorities to work on.\n\nI'll move forward with supporting the PRs (#58051 and #58054) that are ready, while attempting to dispatch the critical issues (#58058 Feishu sync regression and #58041 auto-update crash loop) to aoao through sessions_send. I should also check what #58051 and #58054 involve before proceeding.","thinkingSignature":"c7ff1e4f0a3af26aa73e0d4c0eb8bc0efbad1e32069a7753e4beb0eebe5ff8a5"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 第25轮扫描结果很清晰。现在最紧急的是：\n1. **#58058**（Feishu sync regression）+ **#58041**（auto-update crash loop）→ 派 aoao\n2. **#58051** + **#58054** → 可直接支持 PR\n\n先支持两个小型 PR，同时把最紧急任务派给 aoao。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_m40juxwgjsj6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 58051 --json number,title,body,files,additions,deletions,reviewDecision,url,state --jq '.'\ngh pr view 58054 --json number,title,body,files,additions,deletions,reviewDecision,url,state --jq '.'","timeo