{"type":"message","id":"9605e665","parentId":"a6c0f2f2","timestamp":"2026-03-31T02:12:08.984Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message also fails with 400. This is the same error from the logs. It seems like there's a Feishu API issue - the message tool can't send to aoao's user ID.\n\nLet me think about what's happening:\n1. The Feishu message tool fails with 400 when trying to send to aoao's user ID\n2. sessions_send to aoao times out\n3. Both are consistent with the aoao session having a broken delivery context\n\nThe root issue seems to be with the aoao session configuration. Since I can't fix the session directly, let me try a different approach:\n\n1. Spawn a fresh aoao subagent using sessions_spawn\n\n\n2. Or use the cron system to trigger aoao\n\nWait, let me re-read the aoao session key: `agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`. The delivery context is likely the culprit - if aoao's session was created with webchat delivery but the message is coming from Feishu, that mismatch would explain the failures.\n\nSince the current aoao session seems stuck or misconfigured, I should try spawning a fresh subagent instead of trying to fix the existing one.","thinkingSignature":"25dcc7fb8982fc91c9d9c993dc6db08e4117b27fb61537bf2bc5baad75192a39"},{"type":"text","text":"Feishu message 也失败了。这个问题的根本原因是 aoao 的 session delivery context 配置错误。让我尝试重新 spawn aoao。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cg8qotlgdaff_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是 aoao（熬熬），OpenClaw 项目的全栈工程师复核者。\n\n你的职责：\n1. 接收 main 发来的 bug/issue，评估是否可修\n2. 对于可修的 bug，直接定位根因、写代码、提 PR\n3. 把结果直接回报给 main\n\n你现在有两个紧急任务（来自 xixi 第25轮扫描）：\n\n**任务1（P1）：#58058 - Feishu/Telegram dashboard sync failure**\n- 链接：https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58058\n- 描述：Real-time message and task status sync failure between local dashboard and Feishu/Telegram\n- 版本：2026.3.28 regression\n- 请调研根因，判断是否可提 fix PR。如果可修，直接写代码提 PR。\n\n**任务2（P1）：#58041 - Auto-update crash loop**\n- 链接：https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58041\n- 描述：Auto-update is not atomic，config/plugin version mismatch causes repeated crash loops\n- 根因已定位：auto-update 非原子性，config/plugin manifest 更新后 binary 仍为旧版\n- 请确认根因，评估是否可提 fix PR。如果可修，直接写代码提 PR。\n\n工作目录：/root/.openclaw/workspace/repos/openclaw（如果不存在则先 clone）\n\n结果直接回报给 main（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8）。","label":"aoao-fresh-0327","runtime":"subagent","agentId":"aoao","model":"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2","runTimeoutSeconds":1800,"mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":65020,"output":721,"cacheRead":21716,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774923108776,"responseId":"061a606402fc3420e84bb1814712989e"}}
