{"type":"message","id":"a929e484","parentId":"ba6c9e69","timestamp":"2026-03-31T04:42:21.014Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fan is asking about the current reporting mechanism. Let me check the MEMORY.md and OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md for the reporting mechanism details.","thinkingSignature":"12d149cca10bc4674d5126ddc4512ffbcc673eb3e256b8903f473a507cbcd7ad"},{"type":"text","text":"汇报机制如下：\n\n**定时汇报（自动）**\n- 📮 **每日 9:00** — 项目进展日报推送到本群（群 oc_f68e4447）\n- 🔍 **每日 8:00** — 晨报（天气 + 日历 + 待办 + OpenClaw 进度摘要）\n- ⏰ **cron 反馈检查** — 每 30 分钟自动检查 #54952/#55008/#55013 的 maintainer 新评论，有重要进展立即汇报\n\n**触发式汇报（事件驱动）**\n- 🆕 **xixi 每轮扫描发现高优先级候选** → 立即推送（每小时 ~1 轮）\n- 🔴 **发现 P0/P1 regression** → 立即推送\n- ✅ **重要 PR 被 merge / maintainer 回复** → 立即推送\n- ❌ **阻塞性问题（sessions_send 超时、cron 失败）** → 立即推送\n\n**汇报格式原则**\n- 结论先行，少铺垫\n- 精简（1-3 条核心），不刷屏\n- 详细进展在 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` 实时更新，文件是唯一事实来源"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":278,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":94844,"totalTokens":95202,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774932128010,"responseId":"061a83a094877d65e9d58b25dcaf3d30"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bdb9fe4d","parentId":"a929e484","timestamp":"2026-03-31T04:45:51.173Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-31 12:42 GMT+8] # 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-31 12:28]\n\n## GitHub\n发现了22个新候选（13个issues + 9个PRs），其中最重要的是：\n- **#58119 P0** - 微信通道每天 contextToken 过期断连，需手动重连（bug）\n- **#58109 P0** - v2026.3.28 — Voice transcription broken + web search config stripped on update（regression）\n- **#58107 P1** - Multiple Feishu group agents - only main reply delivered（bug+regression）\n- **#58108 P1** - [Security Concern] Third-party plugin @cc-soul/openclaw ships fully obfuscated code, auto-starts background daemon（安全漏洞）\n- **#58106 P1** - OpenRouter models hidden in model picker — PI auth discovery fails to resolve keyRef auth profiles\n\n## InStreet\n发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（扫描到InStreet Agent平台文档，未发现OpenClaw相关内容）\n\n## Discord\n发现了0个讨论（需要登录认证，无法抓取）\n\n## 插件\n发现0个相关问题（openclaw-weixin仓库返回404，代码不公开）\n\n## 结论\n最高优先级是 **#58109（v2026.3.28 Voice transcription broken）** 和 **#58119（微信通道contextToken过期断连）**，都是P0级严重问题。建议：\n1. 派 aoao 调研 #58109，确认 Voice transcription 和 web search config 被清除的根因\n2. 调研 #58119，了解微信 contextToken 过期机制，寻找自动续期方案\n3. 关注 #58108 安全漏洞，审查 @cc-soul/openclaw 插件的风险\n4. #58107（Feishu 多agent回复静默丢弃）与我们的 multi-agent 协作直接相关，需优先修复\n\n已更新项目文件 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（P254-P266）"}],"timestamp":1774932351132,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"5f3451d2","parentId":"bdb9fe4d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T04:46:10.925Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is an inter-session message from xixi with the 4-direction scan report (round 26). Let me process this:\n\nKey findings:\n- **#58109 P0** - Voice transcription broken + web search config stripped on update (v2026.3.28 regression)\n- **#58119 P0** - WeChat channel contextToken expiration causes daily disconnections\n- **#58107 P1** - Multiple Feishu group agents - only main reply delivered (directly related to our multi-agent setup!)\n- **#58108 P1** - Security: @cc-soul/openclaw ships obfuscated code + auto-starts daemon\n\n\n- **#58106 P1** - OpenRouter models hidden in model picker\n\nThe P0 issues are critical and need immediate attention. For #58107 specifically, this directly impacts our multi-agent workflow since the main agent's reply is being delivered but subagents' responses are being silently dropped. I need to dispatch aoao to investigate the root causes while updating the project file and notifying the user about these findings.","thinkingSignature":"0bcf12744b3851f1770e65c1b385db1a456247859268e94758b0705a9ed546f1"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] xixi 第26轮扫描完成，两个 P0 + 两个 P1 都是严重问题。\n\n**最高优先级：**\n- 🔴 **#58109** — Voice transcription broken + web search config stripped（v2026.3.28 regression）\n- 🔴 **#58119** — 微信通道每天 contextToken 过期断连\n\n**特别关注：**\n- 🔴 **#58107** — Feishu 多 agent 群聊只有 main reply 被送达，subagent reply 静默丢弃 → **直接影响我们 multi-agent 协作！**\n\n已更新项目文件，立即派 aoao 处理。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o81em344xb8j_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是 aoao（熬熬），OpenClaw 全栈工程师。\n\n当前任务（来自 xixi 第26轮扫描）：\n\n**任务1（P0）：#58109 - Voice transcription broken + web search config stripped on update**\n- https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58109\n- v2026.3.28 regression：voice transcription 失效 + web search config 在升级后被清除\n- 请调研根因，判断是否可提 fix PR\n\n**任务2（P1