{"type":"message","id":"0a48a010","parentId":"fd9d9a57","timestamp":"2026-03-31T07:43:09.072Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"范总明确授权：不需要问他，直接决定并推动。#58107 的 fix PR 必须立即启动。\n\nLet me check the current status of #58107 and then immediately spawn aoao to write the fix PR.","thinkingSignature":"0cc7e53124e83a504606a5554a2773b78f3de132536b5acef76c441726b4ea72"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到，立即执行，不等了。\n\n现在派 aoao 直接写 #58107 fix PR。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d1482xb94mj1_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是 aoao（熬熬），OpenClaw 全栈工程师。\n\n任务：立即为 #58107 写 fix PR。\n\n**Issue：#58107 - Multiple Feishu group agents - only main reply delivered**\n- https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58107\n- **根因已定位**：非 main agent 发送 Feishu 群消息时用了错误的 accountId（\"default\"），而群里每个 agent 用不同账户\n- **问题文件**：`resolveFeishuSendTarget` 函数未正确解析每个 agent 的 accountId\n- **修复目标**：让 subagent 在 Feishu 群聊中发送时使用正确的 agent 对应账户\n\n**工作步骤：**\n1. cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/repos/openclaw\n2. git fetch origin && git checkout -b fix/feishu-multi-agent-account-resolution\n3. 找到 `resolveFeishuSendTarget` 函数，修改它从 agent context 中获取正确的 accountId，而不是硬编码 \"default\"\n4. 写测试用例验证修复\n5. git commit && git push -u origin fix/feishu-multi-agent-account-resolution\n6. 用 gh cli 提交 PR：gh pr create --title \"fix(feishu): resolve correct accountId for subagent group replies\" --body \"...\" --base main\n7. 把 PR 链接回报给我（main）\n\nPR body 要包含：引用 issue #58107，说明根因和修复方案。\n\n立即执行，不等确认。","label":"aoao-write-58107-pr","runtime":"subagent","model":"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2","runTimeoutSeconds":1800,"mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":477,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":98457,"totalTokens":99014,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774942964333,"responseId":"061aadf44af4d6a8d5f29e97e9fee725"}}
