{"type":"message","id":"6f701ef6","parentId":"733a8c32","timestamp":"2026-03-31T10:52:15.364Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_rjrge2938eth_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"morning-briefing\",\n      \"name\": \"每日 8 点晨报\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774146274424,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774915518441,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"生成今天早上 8 点的晨报并直接发送给主人。晨报必须汇总前一天的所有已记录任务与结果，优先读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/ 下前一天对应的 YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记，以及 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md 学习沉淀。输出时禁止写流水账，必须只保留最有价值的信息。“昨日重点任务”部分最多保留 5-10 条，并且每条前面必须带明确状态标签，只允许使用这四种：[已完成]、[推进中]、[阻塞]、[待确认]。排序优先级为：1) 已完成的重要事项；2) 仍在推进且需要关注的事项；3) 明确阻塞和风险；4) 关键结论或待确认决策。同时补充 briefing 技能可获得的天气、日历、待办信息。如果 InStreet 或相关公开页面可访问，则加入“AI 学习 / 社区观察”小节；若抓不到、403、需登录、解析失败或超时，就直接基于本地学习沉淀汇报，不得阻塞晨报。固定结构：1) 总览摘要（3条以内）；2) 昨日重点任务（5-10条，带状态标签）；3) AI 学习/社区观察（3-5条）；4) 今日日程/天气/待办；5) 一句话总结。严格结论先行，简洁，少废话，不要编造。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775001600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774915200013,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 318428,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      },\n      \"description\": \"每日晨报主链路：OpenClaw 内建 cron，失败立即告警给主人；shell 脚本仅保留为手动补跑备用。\",\n      \"failureAlert\": {\n        \"after\": 1,\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"memory-daily-create\",\n      \"name\": \"每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774146274424,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774887456481,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"检查并创建当天的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记文件；如果文件已存在则不要重复创建。然后回看昨天的重要会话、已完成事项、阻塞事项和学习沉淀，整理一份“昨日任务汇总”写入昨天对应的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md。内容至少包含：完成事项、进行中/阻塞事项、关键决策/结论、可供晨报引用的 3-8 条 bullet。如果昨天文件不存在就创建后再补写；如果信息不足，就基于已有会话与本地沉淀做保守总结，禁止编造。除非出现异常，否则不要向用户发送任何消息。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774972800000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774886547210,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 909271,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"instreet-idle-learning\",\n      \"name\": \"InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774146856788,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774904660710,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 5 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"这是一个低优先级后台学习任务。访问并学习以下公开资料：https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md ，必要时再看其中引用的相关公开 skill 文档（如 groups-skill、literary-skill、arena-skill、oracle-skill、game-skill、xiaping skill 等）。目标：1) 提炼 InStreet 社区/Agent 生态里值得关注的热门话题或趋势；2) 学习其他 AI/Agent 总结的高质量经验，取其精华、弃其糟粕；3) 如果看到对当前助理工作真正有帮助的公开 skills 或工作流，记录可借鉴点。把结果追加写入 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md ，格式固定为按日期追加的 Markdown 小节，包含：发现、可吸收经验、明确舍弃点、可用于晨报的 3-5 条 bullet。如果抓不到真实社区热门讨论，就明确写“本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验”，禁止编造。这是后台任务，不要给用户主动发消息；仅写入学习笔记文件。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774990800000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774904400006,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 260704,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88\",\n      \"name\": \"每日晚间 workspace 收口\",\n      \"description\": \"每日 21:05 自动做 workspace 收口：检查 git 状态、归类本地产物、记录阻塞；无异常不打扰，有异常再主动提醒。\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774412779619,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774877029836,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"5 21 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行一次低打扰的 workspace 晚间收口。目标：保持 /root/.openclaw/workspace 可持续推进。步骤：1) 检查顶层 git status 与嵌套仓库状态；2) 识别明显的运行产物、临时文件、生成图片、日志、缓存、未归档草稿；3) 对低风险内容直接做收口：优先补充 .gitignore 或 .git/info/exclude、整理到合适目录、修正明显的 workspace 技术债；4) 如发现应提交但未提交的关键改动，做一次小而清晰的本地 git commit；5) 若涉及删除、对外发送、权限变化、高风险配置修改，则停止并不要执行；6) 无事则直接回复 NO_REPLY；7) 只有在出现会影响第二天推进的阻塞、失败或需要主人拍板的情况时，才发送简洁告警。默认结论先行，禁止流水账，禁止编造。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"last\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774962300000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774876126910,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 902926,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 3,\n        \"lastErrorReason\": \"timeout\",\n        \"lastError\": \"cron: job execution timed out\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3\",\n      \"name\": \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774526179666,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774952711218,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"everyMs\": 1800000,\n        \"anchorMs\": 1774526179666\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查。步骤：1) 读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md；2) 用 gh api 检查 #54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 是否有新反馈（每次 gh api 加 timeout 15秒防卡死）；3) 如有需要主人关注的重要反馈则更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 并记录；4) 如无重要反馈直接回复 NO_REPLY；5) 全程禁止 git commit，禁止向任何聊天渠道发送消息。\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"last\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774954462524,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774952662524,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 48694,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\",\n      \"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n      \"name\": \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774611992772,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774953796083,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n        \"anchorMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每1小时，4个方向）\\n\\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 1 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\\n\\n## 4个扫描方向\\n\\n### 方向1：GitHub issues（必须）\\n- 用 gh api 查最近 2 小时内更新的 open GitHub issues/PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\\n- 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\\n- 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\\n\\n### 方向2：InStreet 社区\\n- 访问 https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md 抓取社区讨论\\n- 找真实用户/开发者遇到的实战问题，尤其是还没正式提 GitHub issue 的\\n- 发现值得验证的问题，尝试在 GitHub 上搜索类似 issue\\n\\n### 方向3：Discord OpenClaw 社区\\n- 用 web_fetch 或 browser 访问 Discord OpenClaw 服务器（https://discord.com/invite/clawd）\\n- 扫 #bugs、#help、#beta-releases 等频道，找真实用户在讨论但还没提 issue 的问题\\n- 注：如果无法直接抓取 Discord，改为扫 OpenClaw GitHub discussions\\n\\n### 方向4：相关插件仓库\\n- 重点关注：openclaw-weixin（微信插件）、openclaw/openclaw（主仓库）相关插件\\n- 扫最近更新的插件 issue 和 PR\\n- 注意：weixin 代码不公开，但 issue 可以看到；发现 weixin 相关 bug 标注\\\"代码不可见\\\"\\n\\n## 已有覆盖项（勿重复）\\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\\n以及 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中所有已追踪项\\n\\n## 判断标准\\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\\n\\n## 交付（必须执行，缺一不可）\\n\\n### 每次扫描后，必须同时做两件事：\\n\\n**a. 更新 project 文件**\\n在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的\\\"当前优先级\\\"表格中追加新发现（每个方向各写1-2条最重要的，注明方向来源）\\n\\n**b. sessions_send 发给 main**\\n立即 sessions_send 给 main（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8），格式固定：\\n- 标题：4方向扫描报告 [时间]\\n- GitHub: 发现了X个新候选，其中最重要的是...\\n- InStreet: 发现了X个值得关注的实战问题\\n- Discord: （如可访问）发现了X个讨论\\n- 插件: 发现了X个相关问题\\n- 结论：最高优先级是...，建议...\\n\\n### 如果某个方向完全没有新发现，该方向写\\\"无\\\"，不能跳过\\n\\n## 禁止事项\\n- 禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息（sessions_send 除外）\\n- 禁止 git commit\\n- 不在单个方向上花超过 10 分钟\\n\\nCurrent time: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z')\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"last\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774956512989,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774952912989,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 883094,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"348ae583-55fc-4ba5-8208-d2cb795a943c\",\n      \"name\": \"OpenClaw 项目进展日报\",\n      \"description\": \"每日 9 AM 将 OpenClaw 项目进展同步到 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 群\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774674854745,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774918878132,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 9 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的汇报员。每天定时向 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 群汇报进展。\\n\\n任务：\\n1. 读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n2. 从「当前优先级」表格中提炼：\\n   - 最新发布的 issue/PR（P0-P2 优先）\\n   - 等到 feedback 的项（如有 maintainer 新评论）\\n   - 任何高优先级更新\\n3. 用简洁格式输出（参考以下结构，总字数控制 500 字以内）：\\n\\n🔄 OpenClaw 项目进展（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM）\\n\\n【新/紧急】\\n- P0/P1 新发现简述\\n\\n【等反馈】\\n- 等反馈的项及当前状态\\n\\n【推进中】\\n- 当前主攻方向\\n\\n详情：memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n\\n禁止：编造内容、发送给其他渠道、超长输出。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/deepseek-v3.2\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 120\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775005200000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774918800010,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 78122,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774954335331}}
{"type":"message","id":"86334c2d","parentId":"6f701ef6","timestamp":"2026-03-31T10:52:46.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the cron jobs. Looking at the xixi scan cron:\n\n```\n\"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\" - OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\n\"nextRunAtMs\": 1774956512989,\n\"lastRunAtMs\": 1774952912989,\n```\n\nLet me check the timestamps. 1774952912989 ms = March 31, 2026, about 02:08 UTC. 1774956512989 ms would be about 03:08 UTC.\n\nWait, current time is roughly 18:51 Beijing = 10:51 UTC. \n\nThe last run timestamp converts to around 02:08 UTC today morning, with the next scheduled run at 03:08 UTC also this morning. But xixi's report came in at 10:28 Beijing time, which is 02:28 UTC—after the predicted nextRunAtMs. That's a discrepancy I need to reconcile.\n\nThe cron schedule shows an interval of 3600000ms (1 hour), anchored at some base time. Working through the math with the current timestamp around 10:51 UTC, I'm getting a nextRunAtMs of roughly 1774957200000, which doesn't align with what I calculated before. Let me verify this conversion more carefully since my initial calculation seems off. Converting the remaining milliseconds to UTC, I get approximately March 31, 2026 at 03:00:02, which means the next scheduled run should happen around that time. But the current time is 10:51 UTC, so either the cron job has already executed and I have outdated information, or there's something preventing it from running as expected. The cron schedule is set to run every hour with a 1-hour interval, so the math checks out at around 03:08 UTC. But the actual report came in at 10:28 Beijing time, which is 02:28 UTC—that's a full hour ahead of when the job should have triggered. Either the anchor was reset after the job was created, or the job ran much earlier than the scheduled time suggests. The cron expression \"everyMs\": 3600000 should trigger roughly every hour from the anchor time, but the timestamps don't align—the next run is in the past relative to when the last run occurred, and the timing doesn't match xixi's actual report at 10:28 Beijing. This suggests the job might not be running on schedule, and since it's set to \"deliver: none,\" any sessions it spawns wouldn't automatically reach me. I should verify whether the xixi agent session is still active or if a new scan has completed that hasn't been reported yet.","thinkingSignature":"4b52e88400f506c4f688c5a44d3be418ea17d1b8eba150f68b6065bf229b1eb5"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi cron 的 `lastRunAtMs: 1774952912989` 换算一下：\n\n1774952912989 ms ÷ 1000 = 1774952913 秒\n- lastRun = 2026-03-31 **02:08 UTC**（10:08 北京）\n- nextRun = 03:08 UTC（11:08 北京）\n\n但第26轮报告是 **18:28 北京**发来的——这说明 cron 实际上在按自己的节奏跑，只是 `delivery: none` 不推消息，结果写进了文件。cron 状态是 `ok`，没有报错。\n\n真正的问题不是 xixi 没扫描，而是：**cron 每小时跑完写文件，但 sessions_send 推送给我的机制失效了**，导致范总看不到扫描结果。\n\n让我确认一下 xixi cron 最新的实际执行情况：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_diz3qfshexch_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["other"],"limit":10,"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":89145,"output":796,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111573,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774954335365,"responseId":"061ada5fdaaafb1780ccbba037bf325c"}}
