(from 2026-03-11, old) and the file already noted this.\\n\\nLooking at the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md, the last feedback check entry for #55008 was:\\n\\n\\n- **2026-03-30 09:58**: \\\"EronFan (2026-03-30T01:23:46Z) 在 PR #55008 发了一条重要评论：Skills regression fully fixed\\\"\\n- **2026-03-30 12:33**: Same entry repeated\\n\\nSo the EronFan comment on #55008 is already recorded. There's no new feedback from maintainers.\\n\\nFor #55013, the file already noted at \\\"2026-03-30 09:58（反馈检查 - #55008 maintainer 确认 skills regression 完全修复）\\\" that #55013 only had Greptile old comments. So no new maintainer feedback there either.\\n\\nChecking back through the records, #55008 and #55013 were both checked before - #55008 had EronFan's comment at 09:58 confirming the skills regression was fixed, and #55013 only showed Greptile comments from earlier. No new responses have come in since those timestamps.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"NO_REPLY\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 41852,\n            \"output\": 379,\n            \"totalTokens\": 64508,\n            \"cacheRead\": 22277,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774952694449,\n          \"responseId\": \"061ad3f635694a83d213e3b6963397f0\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"85e1f769\",\n            \"seq\": 11\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:subagent:1ff05186-6f88-47f4-8738-ccd3eb1df62d\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"label\": \"aoao-write-58107-pr\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774943996264,\n      \"sessionId\": \"1c08ba16-e032-4c12-a4eb-a1d38472b257\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-v3.2\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 47686,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1774942990705,\n      \"endedAt\": 1774943979264,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 987613,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/1c08ba16-e032-4c12-a4eb-a1d38472b257.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"太好了！PR 已创建：https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/58228\\n\\n现在让我向 main agent 报告完成情况。根据任务要求，我需要\\\"把 PR 链接回报给我（main）\\\"。\\n\\n作为 subagent aoao，我已经完成了任务：\\n1. 创建了修复分支并修改了代码\\n2. 提交了更改\\n3. 推送了分支\\n4. 创建了 PR #58228\\n\\n修复内容：修改了 `extensions/feishu/src/channel.ts` 以优先使用 `agentAccountId`（用于 subagents）而不是 `ctx.accountId`，确保 subagents 在 Feishu 群聊中使用自己的 accountId 发送消息。\\n\\n现在任务完成。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"arkcode\",\n          \"model\": \"deepseek-v3.2\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 47686,\n            \"output\": 157,\n            \"totalTokens\": 47843,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774943965631,\n          \"responseId\": \"021774943966064d854dce4563ff2226dc4574f2f03d46b25be2a\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"08c08b5d\",\n            \"seq\": 136\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:subagent:7452cc20-aa3a-4715-8ff2-882e692b28eb\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"label\": \"openclaw-p1-heartbeat-compaction\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-agent-main-subagent-7452cc20-aa3a-4715-8ff2-882e692b28eb\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"heartbeat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774942639749,\n      \"sessionId\": \"606037e9-fdcf-40da-bb92-a5849f8837f4\",\n      \"model\": \"openrouter/free\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 18982,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1774940344730,\n      \"endedAt\": 1774942516339,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 2169001,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"heartbeat\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/606037e9-fdcf-40da-bb92-a5849f8837f4.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"The fix is in place. Let me now provide the summary to main. The fix is:1. Added `isBackgroundTrigger` check to skip the live session model switch detection for heartbeat, overflow, and timeout_recovery triggers2. Applied the check to both \\\"before attempt\\\" and \\\"after failed attempt\\\" checks3. For non-background triggers (user), behavior is unchanged\\n\\nThe diff:\\n- Lines 459-472: \\\"before attempt\\\" check modified to skip for background triggers\\n- Lines 630-635: \\\"after failed attempt\\\" check modified to skip for background triggers\\n\\nThe build/test failures are pre-existing environment issues (missing modules like `failover-policy.js`, `usage-accumulator.js`, and plugin SDK modules). \\n\\nThese aren't related to my changes.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"The fix is complete. Let me provide the final summary:\\n\\n---\\n\\n**状态：完成**\\n\\n**任务：** 调研并修复 OpenClaw issue #58137 — Heartbeat/compaction model override broken by live session model switch\\n\\n**问题根因：** `live-model-switch.ts` 中的 live session model switch 检测逻辑在 `runEmbeddedPiAgent` 中会对所有 trigger 类型进行检查。当 heartbeat/compaction 使用与 session primary 不同的 model 时（这是 explicit 配置，不是 live session switch），`resolvePersistedLiveSelection()` 会返回 session primary model，而 `resolveCurrentLiveSelection()` 返回 heartbeat 的 model。虽然 `shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection` 在这种 mismatch 情况下为 `false`，但 `isBackgroundTrigger` 的引入可以更清晰地解决这个问题。\\n\\n**修复方案：** 在 `src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.ts` 中，为 \\\"before attempt\\\" 和 \\\"after failed attempt\\\" 两个 live session model switch 检查添加 `isBackgroundTrigger` 守卫。对于 `trigger === \\\"heartbeat\\\" | \\\"overflow\\\" | \\\"timeout_recovery\\\"` 的后台任务，跳过这些检查，因为它们的 model 配置是 explicit 的，不应触发 live session switch 错误。\\n\\n**Diff：**\\n```diff\\n--- a/src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.ts\\n+++ b/src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.ts\\n@@ -455,10 +455,22 @@ export async function runEmbeddedPiAgent(\\n             };\\n           }\\n           runLoopIterations += 1;\\n+          // Heartbeat, compaction, and other non-interactive background runs have\\n+          // their own explicit model configuration. Skip the live session model switch\\n+          // check for these triggers — a different model than the session primary is\\n+          // expected and intentional, not a live session switch to honor.\\n+          const isBackgroundTrigger =\\n+            params.trigger === \\\"heartbeat\\\" ||\\n+            params.trigger === \\\"overflow\\\" ||\\n+            params.trigger === \\\"timeout_recovery\\\";\\n+          const nextSelection =\\n+            !isBackgroundTrigger && shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection\\n+              ? resolvePersistedLiveSelection()\\n+              : null;\\n-          const nextSelection = shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection\\n-            ? resolvePersistedLiveSelection()\\n-            : null;\\n-          if (hasDifferentLiveSessionModelSelection(resolveCurrentLiveSelection(), nextSelection)) {\\n+          if (\\n+            !isBackgroundTrigger &&\\n+            hasDifferentLiveSessionModelSelection(resolveCurrentLiveSelection(), nextSelection)\\n+          ) {\\n\\n@@ -615,11 +627,12 @@ export async function runEmbeddedPiAgent(\\n           const failedOrAbortedAttempt =\\n             aborted || Boolean(promptError) || Boolean(assistantErrorText) || timedOut;\\n           const persistedSelection =\\n-            failedOrAbortedAttempt && shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection\\n+            failedOrAbortedAttempt && !isBackgroundTrigger && shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection\\n               ? resolvePersistedLiveSelection()\\n               : null;\\n           if (\\n             failedOrAbortedAttempt &&\\n+            !isBackgroundTrigger &&\\n             canRestartForLiveSwitch &&\\n             hasDifferentLiveSessionModelSelection(resolveCurrentLiveSelection(), persistedSelection)\\n           ) {\\n```\\n\\n**测试：** 尝试运行 `vitest run src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.overflow-compaction.test.ts` 失败，但原因是预先存在的环境问题（缺少 `failover-policy.js`、`usage-accumulator.js` 等编译产物），与本次修改无关。构建同样因缺失模块失败，非代码问题。\\n\\n**建议：** 1) 在 CI 环境中验证 build 通过后 merge；2) 可考虑补充 heartbeat/compaction 相关的 live-model-switch 测试用例。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 72980,\n            \"output\": 921,\n            \"totalTokens\": 91241,\n            \"cacheRead\": 17340,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774942481466,\n          \"responseId\": \"061aac113ec6f67902abf83c923a87ce\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"266f0cf0\",\n            \"seq\": 364\n          }\n        }\n      ]