{"type":"message","id":"db8bb0f2","parentId":"37c2d15a","timestamp":"2026-03-31T10:55:29.322Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the issue clearly now. The xixi cron job has:```json\"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n\"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n\"delivery\": {\n  \"mode\": \"none\",\n  \"channel\": \"last\"\n}\n```\n\nThis creates an isolated session that can't deliver messages via sessions_send. The fix is to change `sessionTarget` to `\"current\"` so it runs within the current main session, which is the active Feishu-backed session.\n\nBut wait - if I change to `sessionTarget: \"current\"`, it will run as the main agent, not as xixi. \n\nThat's actually fine though, since the payload message contains the xixi identity and context. Looking at the other cron jobs like morning-briefing and daily reports, they work fine with `sessionTarget: \"isolated\"` because they use `delivery: { \"mode\": \"announce\", \"channel\": \"feishu\", ... }` - so the cron system itself handles the delivery. The xixi cron is different because it's trying to use sessions_send directly instead of relying on the cron system's built-in delivery mechanism.\n\nThe fix is to change xixi's cron to use `sessionTarget: \"current\"` so it runs in my active session where I can receive the sessions_send messages properly.","thinkingSignature":"0a755e7c6179814df6f208db5ca538359476d5328d6459b47d391593733331b1"},{"type":"text","text":"isolated session 无法 sessions_send。需要把 `sessionTarget` 改成 `\"current\"`，让它跑在我这个 active session 里。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r5txft58hf6c_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json') as f:\n    jobs = json.load(f)\nfor job in jobs['jobs']:\n    if job.get('id') == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        old = job.get('sessionTarget')\n        job['sessionTarget'] = 'current'\n        print(f'Changed sessionTarget: {old!r} -> {job[\\\"sessionTarget\\\"]!r}')\n        break\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(jobs, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('Saved.')\n\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":106356,"output":496,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":128484,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774954515117,"responseId":"061adb1380d5c1d3b8085ec747f914cc"}}
