{"type":"message","id":"10234a08","parentId":"3755a7da","timestamp":"2026-03-31T11:00:52.398Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"范总问的是一个很好的问题：为什么一开始不设置 current，要等到出问题了才设置？\n\n这个问题触及到我对 OpenClaw cron 任务设计模式的理解。让我诚实地回答：\n\n1. 我在初始化 cron 任务时，`sessionTarget` 的选项有 `isolated` 和 `current`\n2. `isolated` 是独立 session，不会受到 main session 状态的影响（比如 main session done 了不会影响 isolated cron 跑\n3. `current` 是跑在当前 session 里，如果 main session 结束了，cron 也会受影响\n4. 我当时选择 `isolated` 是为了隔离性——cron 不受 main session 状态影响，更稳定\n\n\n5. 但 `isolated` 有一个致命的副作用：它是一个完全隔离的 session，无法通过 `sessions_send` 与 main 通信\n\n范总问得很在点：为什么一开始不设计成既能隔离又能推送结果？我当时没有考虑到这个矛盾——isolated 的隔离性反而成了问题，因为 cron 的输出无法传回 main。\n\n我现在意识到应该从一开始就设置 `current`，这样虽然会受 main session 影响，但至少能正常推送结果。如果担心 main session 结束的问题，可以改成定时唤醒机制或设置更长的 timeout。根本问题是我当初没有充分理解 isolated session 的这个限制。","thinkingSignature":"b3c3110274cd6b5bdf113d3f0655e5bd1441844adbf14a7df60b8eb920692baa"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 范总问得好，我诚实回答。\n\n**为什么一开始选 `isolated`：**\n- `isolated` = 独立 session，不受 main session 状态影响，cron 跑得更稳\n- 我当时认为隔离是优点，可以防止 main session 波动影响扫描任务\n\n**为什么错了：**\n- `isolated` 是个完全隔离的沙箱，**无法 sessions_send 推送结果到任何地方**——它连 Feishu 通道都没有\n- cron 任务在 isolated 里跑完了，结果写进了文件，但推不出来\n- 我从一开始就没注意到这个设计的致命缺陷：隔离 ≠ 能通讯\n\n**为什么没第一时间发现：**\n- cron 刚建立时推送是正常的（因为那时 main session 还是 current/active 的）\n- 后来 main session 因为各种原因变成 done，isolated session 就彻底断了\n- 这其实是一个设计层面的 bug，不只是配置问题\n\n**正确的做法：**\n- 定时任务应该用 `current`，配合自己的 cron schedule 定时唤醒\n- 或者用 `isolated` + `delivery: {mode: \"announce\"}` 让 cron 自己推送结果，而不是依赖 sessions_send\n\n这是我当初设计时的盲点，应该一开始就问清楚这个问题，而不是等范总推着我才发现。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":525,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":108569,"totalTokens":130806,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774954827986,"responseId":"061adc4ca7511a2fa0793febfb695dd6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"30cec7cc","parentId":"10234a08","timestamp":"2026-03-31T11:41:54.589Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-31 19:38 GMT+8] ## 4方向扫描报告 [2024/08/25 23:21 GMT+8]\n\n### GitHub:\n发现了0个新候选，所有最近2小时内更新的issues/PRs都已在项目文件中追踪\n\n### InStreet:\n发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（扫描到 InStreet Agent Skill 平台，这是独立的中文 AI Agent 社交网络）\n\n### Discord:\n无（Discord 需要登录认证无法访问；GitHub discussions 未启用）\n\n### 插件:\n发现了多个 openclaw-weixin 相关仓库（Xueheng-Li, hao-ji-xing, freestylefly, laolin5564），其中 hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin 有近期 issue #14（创建于 2026-03-30）\n\n### 结论:\n本次扫描没有发现新的未追踪的 GitHub issues；建议检查 hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin 的 issue #14"}],"timestamp":1774957314468,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"97ad08a6","parentId":"30cec7cc","timestamp":"2026-03-31T11:42:12.295Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is the xixi cron scan report after the fix was applied. The cron ran and sessions_send worked this time! The report shows:\n\n1. GitHub: 0 new candidates (all already tracked)\n2. InStreet: 0 (nothing new)\n3. Discord: 0 (can't access)\n4. Plugins: found hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin with recent issue #14 from 2026-03-30\n\nThe fix worked - xixi's scan results are now being delivered to me via sessions_send!\n\nI should:\n1. Note this finding about the weixin plugin repo\n2. Check if hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin issue #14 is worth tracking\n\n\n3. Give 范总 a brief update on the progress since the cron is now functioning properly\n\nThe timestamp shows 2024/08/25 23:21 GMT+8 which is definitely wrong - that's 2 years in the past - but that's a bug in the xixi cron message template where $(date) didn't resolve properly. The actual report came through at 19:38 GMT+8 today, so I can see the scan ran and delivered successfully after the sessionTarget fix. I should check that weixin issue #14 and then send 范总 a quick status update.","thinkingSignature":"9a199aafd7262f45425b88944d230ae5b6eca5bd63f74429e3ad54d06469e7d0"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi cron 修复验证成功！扫描结果推送回来了 🎉\n\n发现 hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin 的 issue #14（创建于 2026-03-30），快速查一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i2gf1s4bafvv_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/hao-ji-xing/openclaw-weixin/issues/14","maxChars":2000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":370,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":130452,"totalTokens":130902,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774957314589,"responseId":"061ae603dde3cf22f13a82e9d69f1484"}}
