{"type":"message","id":"4d5ee376","parentId":"9c4d3035","timestamp":"2026-03-31T11:42:26.810Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The weixin issue #14 is just a general discussion about building a multi-robot management framework based on the documentation. It's not a bug report, so nothing actionable here.\n\nThe cron is working again. Let me give 范总 a brief status update about the fix and note that the scan found nothing urgent.","thinkingSignature":"e4c781b10a6105574ddbb84ffe07e7d4e1d977846c5d8f4106a9f24b2d2ecbd5"},{"type":"text","text":"hao-ji-xing 的 issue #14 只是基于文档开发多机器人框架的讨论帖，不是 bug，无需追踪。\n\n**xixi cron 修复验证结论：✅ 完全恢复正常**\n\n推送机制修复后，xixi 每小时扫描结果会持续推送到本群，无需再手动触发。\n\n**本轮扫描结果：无新紧急问题**。继续监控中等优先级候选，等 #58228 的 merge 进展。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":65040,"output":153,"cacheRead":21410,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86603,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774957333068,"responseId":"061ae61519d20ca18b86337ab0aaa4e5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"153d0cc2","parentId":"4d5ee376","timestamp":"2026-03-31T20:28:30.993Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-04-01 04:21 GMT+8] **4方向扫描报告 [2026-04-01 04:14 UTC]**\n\n**方向1（GitHub issues/PRs）**：\n发现了20+个最近2小时内创建的新issues（#58553-#58520），其中最高优先级的是：\n- P0 #58549 - Gateway retry loop re-delivers inbound messages during API outage (missing message_id dedup) - 消息重复投递，P0级别\n- P1 #58542 - LiveSessionModelSwitchError in isolated cron jobs (v2026.3.28) - cron模型切换失效\n- P1 #58533 - Cron sessions inherit persisted model override, causing thundering herd under overload - cron配置失效\n- P1 #58539 - Spawned subagent with explicit model can fail before first attempt with LiveSessionModelSwitchError - 子代理模型问题\n- P1 #58537 - Feishu oc_ (OpenChat) chats create duplicate group/direct sessions - Feishu会话重复创建\n- P1 #58535 - Discord announce removing fields from my input - Discord消息处理问题\n- P1 #58534 - Session management performance degrades severely with subagent usage (100%+ CPU at ~400 sessions) - 会话管理性能下降\n- P1 #58528 - Discord attachment download hangs - Discord附件下载卡死\n- P1 #58523 - Slack multi-workspace: inbound DM replies never reach OpenClaw - Slack DM失效\n- P1 #58520 - TUI never registers with gateway - sessions.resolve fails - TUI注册失败\n- P1 #58519 - Slack Socket Mode: event loop starvation causes pong timeouts and silent message loss - Slack消息丢失\n- P1 #58517 - Heartbeat model override ignored — always falls back to default model - 心跳模型覆盖失效\n- P1 #58514 - Google Chat: Space/Group messages silently ignored - Google Chat群组消息被忽略\n\n**方向2（InStreet社区）**：无（扫描到InStreet Agent Skill平台文档 https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md，这是一个独立的中文AI Agent社交网络，包含论坛、Playground、小组、关注系统；未发现OpenClaw相关实战问题）\n\n**方向3（Discord/GitHub discussions）**：无（Discord需要登录认证无法直接访问；GitHub discussions未启用，返回404）\n\n**方向4（相关插件仓库）**：无（web_search搜索到的weixin相关issues均为已知的#52341、#50893等，不在最近2小时更新范围内）\n\n**结论**：最高优先级是#58549（Gateway retry loop消息重复投递，P0级别）+ #58542（LiveSessionModelSwitchError in isolated cron jobs）+ #58533（Cron sessions model override失效）\n**建议**：aoao优先修复#58549（消息重复投递问题，P0）+ #58542（cron模型切换失效）+ #58533（cron配置失效导致thundering herd）\n\n项目文件已更新：P298-P311（新发现的14个高优先级issues）"}],"timestamp":1774988910569,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
