{"type":"message","id":"4050a2f5","parentId":"786b5d31","timestamp":"2026-03-31T20:29:46.309Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user message says \"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\" This seems to be a system message indicating that my previous response generation attempt failed or hit a timeout.\n\nLet me acknowledge this and continue with what I was doing. I had just finished reporting the xixi scan results to 范总, noting that:\n1. xixi cron scan fix was successfully applied\n2. The scan found nothing urgent\n3. I checked the hao-ji-xing weixin issue #14 which was just a documentation discussion\n\nThe next logical step would be to wait for the next xixi cron cycle and then report back to 范总 with any new findings. Since the user is asking me to \"continue where you left off\", it suggests there might have been a system interruption or timeout that cut off my previous response.\n\nI should briefly acknowledge and indicate I'm ready to continue monitoring or responding to further questions.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"收到，继续监控。\n\n**当前状态：**\n- ✅ xixi cron 修复验证成功，每小时扫描恢复推送\n- ⏳ #58228（Feishu subagent + auto-update fix）等 maintainer merge\n- ⏳ 14 个 P0/P1 问题（#58549 Gateway retry loop、#58542 cron 模型切换失效等）待派 aoao 调研\n\n等下一轮扫描结果，有新紧急候选立即处理。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":100040,"output":302,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100342,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774988942655,"responseId":"0217749889459891e8917f6489049782b636a98f4bd750cca8552"}}
