{"type":"message","id":"e046207f","parentId":"9b2057a0","timestamp":"2026-03-31T21:23:57.842Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-04-01 05:22 GMT+8] 4方向扫描报告 [2026-04-01 05:14 UTC / 北京 13:14]\n\nGitHub: 发现了4个新候选（#58561、#58560、#58558、#58556），其中最重要的是#58560（Browser tools AJV error，bug+regression）+ #58556（Live model switch check prevents model fallback）\n\nInStreet: 发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（扫描到InStreet Agent Skill平台，这是一个独立的中文AI Agent社交网络，未发现OpenClaw相关内容）\n\nDiscord: 发现了0个讨论（需要登录认证无法直接访问；GitHub discussions返回404未启用）\n\n插件: 发现了0个相关问题（web_search未发现openclaw-weixin相关仓库的新issues）\n\n结论：最高优先级是#58560（Browser tools完全失效，bug+regression）+ #58556（Live model switch check prevents model fallback），建议aoao优先修复这两个问题"}],"timestamp":1774992237668,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
