{"type":"message","id":"f8071ec2","parentId":"ccc8f46e","timestamp":"2026-03-31T21:25:25.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the project file has been updated. Now let me report to 范总 about the current status.\n\nWait, this is a group chat. I should just report concisely. Let me think about what 范总 might want to know.\n\nCurrent status:\n1. xixi cron fully recovered - scans now push directly to this group\n2. New P1 issues found: #58560 (browser tools AJV error), #58556 (live model switch check prevents fallback)\n3. aoao dispatched to handle these two issues\n4. #58228 still waiting for maintainer merge\n5. 14 P1 issues from the 31st scan still pending action\n\n\n6. 范总 just woke up and will likely want to know what's been happening overnight\n\nI should send a concise summary highlighting the key findings and what actions are underway.","thinkingSignature":"b3149bf0d8775ed9c29038392cf9c0311cf639d3803d499e69667df81a72ad84"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] xixi cron 完全恢复 🎉 直接推到本群了。\n\n**本轮新发现（北京时间 13:14 扫描）：**\n- 🔴 **#58560** — Browser tools AJV error（regression，浏览器工具完全失效）\n- 🔴 **#58556** — Live model switch check 阻止正常 fallback\n\n**已派 aoao 处理**，结果出来后立即汇报。\n\n**另：昨晚 14 个 P1 积压（#58549 Gateway retry loop 消息重复投递等）仍未处理**，等 aoao 跑完 #58560/#58556 后建议继续清。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":68451,"output":310,"cacheRead":21410,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90171,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774992317107,"responseId":"061b6ebd3674250ffebf2ca1f772eb57"}}
