{"type":"message","id":"3096ef21","parentId":"da34bf42","timestamp":"2026-04-01T06:12:03.612Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good overview. Let me also check if there are any actual PR links that were submitted by us (EronFan/aoao). The PR I know about is #58228. Let me check if there are any others. Also #54952 and #54964 were our published issues.\n\nLet me compile the list of all PRs and issues we've submitted:\n\n1. **#54952** - Diagnostics gap issue (published by us)\n2. **#54964** - Session zombie state after init failure (published by us)\n3. **#55013** - docs(channels/feishu) routing fallback clarification (PR created by us)\n\n\n4. **#56173** - Security vulnerability GHSA submitted (not a PR but a security advisory)\n5. **#58228** - Feishu subagent accountId fix + auto-update crash loop (our PR that was merged by EronFan)\n\nThe security advisory and our PR are the main contributions here.","thinkingSignature":"35c720b3b54055b2ffbd000540180e1e81480fc9d2ff43747e3e5f1ee6db098c"},{"type":"text","text":"根据项目文件，整理如下：\n\n---\n\n**我们提交的 Issue / PR（全部来自 EronFan 账号）：**\n\n| 类型 | 编号 | 内容 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| Issue | [#54952](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54952) | Diagnostics gap：暴露 inbound routing 是否匹配 binding | 等 feedback |\n| Issue | [#54964](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54964) | Session zombie state after init failure | 等 feedback |\n| Issue | [#56173](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/56173) | 安全漏洞：/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard（CVSS 9.9）| GHSA 已提交，等私下联系 |\n| PR | [#58228](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/58228) | fix(feishu)：subagent 用正确 accountId 发送群消息 **+** 修复 auto-update crash loop | ✅ **已 merge** |\n\n---\n\n**我们支持过的外部 PR（review + approve）：**\n\n| PR | 内容 | 备注 |\n|----|------|------|\n| [#55008](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55008) | Skills regression fully fixed | Maintainer 确认修复完成 |\n| [#55013](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55013) | Feishu routing fallback clarification docs | 等 review |\n| [#55153](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55153) | Kimi malformed-args fix | Approved |\n| [#55137](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55137) | ACP terminal ANSI stripping | Approved + question |\n| [#55466](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55466) | Feishu CardKit streaming card 文本读取 | Approved，可 merge |\n\n---\n\n**核心产出：#58228 是目前唯一由我们驱动的已 merge PR**，一石二鸟修复了 #58107（Feishu subagent reply 丢弃）+ #58041（auto-update crash loop）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78749,"output":643,"cacheRead":23071,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102463,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775023897432,"responseId":"061bea19b244a8ff636b179212313fc2"}}
