b issues/PRs）**：发现大量最近2小时内更新的issues/PRs（从#58202到#58339），但都在项目文件中已追踪（P66-P274），无新增未追踪项\n  - **#58342（新）** - browser.request gateway method not registered in 2026.3.28（高优先级regression，2026.3.24→3.28浏览器功能完全失效）\n  - **#58353（新）** - [Bug]: Control UI /new or /reset can prepend stale system-summary text（中等优先级bug，新会话污染，间歇性）\n  - **#58363（新）** - [Bug]: kimi web_search run error（低优先级，已有PR #58120修复）\n  - 其他多为PR或feature request\n- **方向2（InStreet社区）**：无（扫描到InStreet Agent Skill平台文档，未发现OpenClaw相关问题）\n- **方向3（Discord/GitHub discussions）**：无（Discord需要登录认证无法直接访问；GitHub discussions页面返回404，未启用）\n- **方向4（插件仓库）**：无（openclaw-weixin仓库404，代码不公开；扫描其他openclaw相关仓库未发现2小时内更新的issues）\n- **xixi 结论**：本次扫描发现3个新issues（排除已有追踪项），其中最高优先级是#58342（浏览器功能完全失效）\n- **建议**：aoao优先修复#58342（浏览器功能失效，2026.3.28 regression）+ #58353（Control UI新会话污染问题）\n- 已更新：P295-P297\n### 2026-03-31 04:28（4方向扫描 - 第22轮新发现）\n- **xixi 4方向扫描**（2026-03-30 20:28 UTC）：\n- **方向1（GitHub issues）**：发现19个最近2小时内更新的issues（#57602之后，排除PRs），全部为新发现\n  - **#57898（新）** - [Bug]: ARE YOU GOING TO FRIGGING KEEP BREAKING THIS THING OR WE CAN GET A STABLE VERSION???????（bug+regression）\n  - **#57925（新）** - v2026.3.28: Discord extension silently skipped during gateway startup — zero channels load despite valid config\n  - **#57920（新）** - Stale ended subagent runs persist in childSessions, ghost agents on Floor\n  - **#57683（新）** - [Bug]: 400 gemini-2.5-pro thinking_budget to 0（bug+bug:behavior）\n  - **#57918（新）** - [Bug]: Announce delivery constructs malformed recipient \"group:<chatId>\" for Telegram forum topic sessions（bug+bug:behavior）\n  - **#57917（新）** - Control UI model switch misparses aliases like gpt-5.4 as anthropic/*\n  - **#57916（新）** - Subagent announce: swap dispatch order to queue-first when parent session is busy\n  - **#57908（新）** - [Feature]: Allow prompt-level selection of LLM service provider（enhancement）\n  - **#57776（新）** - [Bug]: Matrix device verification fails with \"m.mismatched_sas\" despite matching emoji（bug+regression）\n  - **#57907（新）** - openclaw configure --section model leaves stale claude-cli/ prefix in model config\n  - **#57906（新）** - Model fallback retries primary too aggressively before moving to next fallback\n  - **#57905（新）** - Gateway enters infinite model-switch loop when all auth profiles fail\n  - **#57901（新）** - Safeguard compaction ignores compaction.model config — uses session model instead\n  - **#57900（新）** - Subagent runs don't use model fallback chain on 429/rate-limit errors\n  - **#57892（新）** - iMessage bridge drops inbound messages during high session lane activity\n  - **#57896（新）** - [Bug]: Gateway restart leaves stale exec config — onRestart passes activate:false to activateRuntimeSecrets\n  - **#57894（新）** - [Feature] Time-based session context window (send only recent N hours of conversation)\n  - **#57893（新）** - [Bug] Feishu slash commands not working in multi-account setup\n  - **#57890（新）** - feat(cron): add structured job-completion record to detect partial/incomplete cron cycles\n- **方向2（InStreet社区）**：无（扫描到InStreet平台文档，未发现OpenClaw相关问题）\n- **方向3（（Discord/GitHub discussions）**：无（web_search搜索到的结果都是已知的GitHub issues，Discord需要认证无法直接访问）\n- **方向4（插件仓库）**：无（openclaw-weixin等插件仓库不存在或不可公开访问）\n- **xixi 结论**：本次扫描发现19个新issues（#57602之后），最高优先级是#57898（用户情绪严重，regression）和#57925（v2026.3.28 Discord regression）\n- 已更新：P227-P245\n\n\n### 2026-04-01 03:14（4方向扫描 - 第30轮扫描）\n- **xixi 4方向扫描**（2026-04-01 03:14 UTC）：\n- **方向1（GitHub issues）**：发现19个最近2小时内更新的items\n  - **#58534** - Session management performance degrades severely with subagent usage (100%+ CPU at ~400 sessions)\n\n[102 more lines in file. Use offset=2500 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775024149772}}
{"type":"message","id":"a22662f0","parentId":"278421c1","timestamp":"2026-04-01T06:16:30.392Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough information to compile a comprehensive statistical summary. Let me count from what I can see:\n\n1. The priority table goes from P1 to at least P180+ in the file\n2. Let me count what we can identify:\n\nFrom the data I've seen:\n- P1-P43: Various issues tracked early on\n- P44: Security issue #56173 (GHSA submitted)\n- P45: weixin regression \n- P46 onwards: More issues\n\nKey accomplishments to summarize:\n1. **Submitted issues**: #54952, #54964, #56173 (GHSA), #58228 (PR - merged)\n\n\n2. **Supported PRs**: #55008, #55013, #55153, #55137, #55466, and several others including #56234, #56203, #56247, #56244, #56204, #56250\n3. **aoao tasks completed**: Multiple bug investigations and fixes including #58107, #58109, #58041, #58137, #58152, #58132, and several others with root causes identified\n4. **Current priorities**: P0 issues like #58549, #58553, #57321, #57303, and P1 issues including #58542, #58533, #58539, #58537, #58535, #58534\n\n, #58528, #58523, #58520, #58519, #58517, #58514, plus #58560 and #58556\n\nLooking at the priority table structure, it appears to span from P1 through P180+, though there are duplicates scattered throughout. I should organize this into a clearer statistical summary for the user.\n\nKey accomplishments so far: we've successfully merged one pull request and have another under review, identified roughly 5-6 P0/P1 issues that aoao has been working through, and completed about 7 investigations. We're also tracking over 180 issues overall across the priorities. Let me build out a proper summary for 范总.","thinkingSignature":"d7ed6ead592f1fbf102191c90097ce3e299cf8c8da7f8a6f5c932c58cb7a7b24"},{"type":"text","text":"根据项目文件，整理统计如下：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 整体统计（截至 2026-04-01）\n\n**xixi 扫描轮次**：30+ 轮（每轮 4 方向）\n**追踪 issues/PRs**：180+ 个（P1 ~ P180+）\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已完成\n\n**Issue 提交（EronFan 账号）**\n| 编号 | 内容 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| #54952 | Diagnostics gap：暴露 inbound routing 是否匹配 binding | 等 feedback |\n| #54964 | Session zombie state after init failure | 等 feedback |\n| #56173 | 安全漏洞：/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard（CVSS 9.9）| GHSA 已提交，等私下联系 |\n\n**PR 提交**\n| 编号 | 内容 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **#58228** | fix(feishu)：修复 subagent 群聊用错 accountId **+** auto-update crash loop（一石二鸟）| ✅ **已 merge** |\n\n**外部 PR 支持（review + approve）**\n- #55008（Skills regression fixed）、#55013、#55153、#55137、#55466\n- #56234（security audit 增强）、#56203、#56247、#56244、#56204、#56250\n\n**aoao 根因调研 + 修复完成**\n- #58107（Feishu subagent reply 丢弃）→ 出 PR\n- #58041（auto-update crash loop）→ 合并入 #58228\n- #58109（voice transcription + web search config）\n- #58137（heartbeat model override broken）\n- #58152（Control UI model switch dropdown）\n- #58132（session-memory 截断 + MiniMax TTS hex/base64 等 7 个根因）\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 当前 P0/P1 积压（待处理）\n\n**P0（消息重复投递/OOM/崩溃）**\n- #58549：Gateway retry loop 消息重复投递\n- #57321：Matrix 永久消息丢失\n- #57303：Kubernetes OOM regression\n- #57349：Heap exhaustion ~17-20小时后 OOM\n\n**P1（影响范总自己使用的）**\n- #58560：**Browser tools AJV error**（regression，浏览器自动化失效）— aoao 处理中\n- #58556：Live model switch check 阻止 fallback — aoao 处理中\n- #58542/58517：Heartbeat/Cron 模型覆盖失效\n- #58533：Cron sessions 模型 override 失效导致 thundering herd\n- #58272/58189：macOS 路径解析 + VLLM 卡死循环\n\n---\n\n**节奏评估**：追踪量大，aoao 处理速度跟不上新发现速度，建议集中兵力清 P0/P1 高优先级阻塞项。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":86843,"output":1042,"cacheRead":23071,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110956,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775024149805,"responseId":"061beb16d87f5acea270030b28c84fd1"}}
