{"type":"message","id":"e2df30e6","parentId":"2d32a399","timestamp":"2026-04-01T07:58:31.654Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Need concise list.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169ccd021b49c8191addf069ea55265b0\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 现在这套分工里，模型大致是这样：\n\n### 1. main（我，对你直接回复）\n- **当前主会话模型**：`openai-codex/gpt-5.4`\n- 用途：对外回复、决策、编排、汇总\n\n### 2. xixi（扫描/调研）\n- **cron 扫描常用**：`arkcode/glm-4.7`\n- 用途：每小时扫 GitHub / 社区 / 插件仓库，提炼候选问题\n\n### 3. aoao（修 bug / 写 PR）\n- **派单常用**：`arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n- 用途：读 issue、查根因、改代码、提 PR\n\n### 4. 其他补充\n- 有些老 cron / 子任务会临时落到：\n  - `MiniMax-M2.7`\n  - `openrouter/free`\n- 但 **OpenClaw 项目主力配置** 现在就是：\n  - **main → gpt-5.4**\n  - **xixi → glm-4.7**\n  - **aoao → deepseek-v3.2**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接把这三个人的模型配置**彻底统一固化**，避免以后漂移。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169ccd021d8308191a4f821f73805b503\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":473,"output":312,"cacheRead":175744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":176529,"cost":{"input":0.0011825000000000002,"output":0.00468,"cacheRead":0.043935999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.049798499999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775030301332,"responseId":"resp_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169ccd01e25e48191ab619273b9be876d"}}
