{"type":"message","id":"731b38dd","parentId":"ff2e996e","timestamp":"2026-04-01T10:29:10.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我现在对模型配置有了全面的了解。让我为范总整理一份清晰的总结。\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 完整模型配置如下：\n\n### Providers（6个）\n\n| Provider | API 类型 | 可用模型 |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| **glmcode** | anthropic-messages | GLM-5.1, GLM-5-Turbo, GLM-5, GLM-4.7, GLM-4.6, GLM-4.5-Air, GLM-4.5 |\n| **arkcode** | anthropic-messages | doubao-seed-2.0-code, doubao-seed-2.0-pro, ark-code-latest, deepseek-v3.2, glm-4.7, kimi-k2-thinking, kimi-k2.5 |\n| **minimax** | anthropic-messages | MiniMax-M2.7, M2.5, M2.5-highspeed, M2.5-Lightning, M2.1, M2.1-lightning, M2 |\n| **bujing** | anthropic-messages | Claude Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6, Haiku 4.5 |\n| **openrouter** | openai-completions | StepFun Step-3.5 Flash (free), NVIDIA Nemotron 120B (free), OpenRouter Free |\n| **doubao** | openai-completions | Doubao Seedream 5.0（生图用） |\n\n### Agents 默认模型\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|---|\n| **primary** | `glmcode/GLM-5.1` |\n| **fallbacks** | `arkcode/glm-4.7` → `arkcode/doubao-seed-2.0-code` |\n| **heartbeat** | `doubao-seed-2.0-code` |\n\n### 各 Agent 实际使用\n\n| Agent | 当前主用 | 说明 |\n|-------|---------|------|\n| **main（我）** | `openai-codex/gpt-5.4`（OAuth） | 这个群会话实际落到 Codex OAuth |\n| **xixi** | `arkcode/glm-4.7` | cron 扫描任务 |\n| **aoao** | `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2` | 派单修 bug |\n| **ling / weiwei** | 继承默认 `GLM-5.1` | 目前不常用 |\n\n### ⚠️ 注意点\n1. **main 实际跑的是 `gpt-5.4`**（通过 openai-codex OAuth），不是配置里的 primary `GLM-5.1`——因为 openai-codex auth profile 优先级更高\n2. **doubao provider** 只有 Seedream 生图模型，没有对话模型\n3. **bujing provider** 有 Claude 全家桶但不太常用"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"glmcode","model":"GLM-5.1","usage":{"input":130845,"output":637,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":136090,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775039319401,"responseId":"msg_20260401182841b076331d714740c6"}}
