{"type":"message","id":"37f7bcd7","parentId":"28c20a1d","timestamp":"2026-04-01T13:59:38.915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我现在没法**精确确认**，因为当前环境拿不到 **#58228 的 review / timeline comments 正文**。\n\n卡点很明确：\n\n- **web_fetch** 只能抓到 PR 主体说明，抓不到完整评论区\n- **browser** 现在连不上本机 Chrome（没有可用登录态）\n- **gh CLI** 这边也没直接可用的已认证上下文给我读评论\n\n所以我现在能负责任地说的是：\n\n- **我不能编造**\n- **当前不能精确确认其它机器人具体说了什么**\n\n如果你要我继续精确查，最直接的办法是：\n1. 让我拿到一个 **可用的 GitHub 登录态浏览器**\n2. 或者你这边给我跑一条：\n   `gh pr view 58228 --repo openclaw/openclaw --comments`\n   然后把输出贴给我\n\n你要的是“精确确认”，那我就不给你半吊子结论。现在客观上还差评论正文入口。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd24c3b16c819195cf7172fa26bb08\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":150048,"output":244,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":150292,"cost":{"input":0.37512,"output":0.00366,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.37878}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775051966045,"responseId":"resp_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd24be8d58819197d21e8811758201"}}
{"type":"message","id":"705d8e69","parentId":"37f7bcd7","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:00:43.332Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53e61e4e90b0b4b0a8dd852fc66\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-01 22:00 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53e61e4e90b0b4b0a8dd852fc66]\n范: 拿到一个 可用的 GitHub 登录态浏览器\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1775052043285}}
{"type":"message","id":"62e57c29","parentId":"705d8e69","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:00:52.762Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，但这一步需要你这边配合一下浏览器登录态。\n\n我这里现在的问题不是不会查，而是 **当前没有可附着的已登录 Chrome**。  \n刚才 browser 工具报错很明确：\n\n- 本机 **Chrome 没有运行**\n- 或 **没有开启 remote debugging**\n- 所以我拿不到你现成的 GitHub 登录态\n\n你现在这样做，最快：\n\n### 你需要做的\n1. 打开 **Chrome**\n2. 保持你已经登录 GitHub 的那个 profile\n3. 打开：\n   `chrome://inspect/#remote-debugging`\n4. 确认 Chrome 开了远程调试  \n   如果没开，就用这个方式启动一次 Chrome：\n\n```bash\n/Applications/Google\\ Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google\\ Chrome --remote-debugging-port=9222\n```\n\n### 你做完后\n回我一句：**“好了”**\n\n我就立刻去精确看 **#58228** 页面上：\n- 谁评论了\n- 是不是机器人\n- 具体说了什么\n- review 是 approve / comment / request changes 哪种","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd250e326881918c3a8f7b84dc6bb0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":758,"output":261,"cacheRead":149888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":150907,"cost":{"input":0.0018950000000000002,"output":0.003915,"cacheRead":0.037472,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.043282}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775052043324,"responseId":"resp_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd250befcc81919c70c59b486cec42"}}
{"type":"message","id":"07aa8ddd","parentId":"62e57c29","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:02:05.476Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53e61b686d0cb2db9e8d0929648\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-01 22:02 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53e61b686d0cb2db9e8d0929648]\n范: 我希望你以后可以自行查询页面反馈，有什么长久的办法\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1775052125426}}
{"type":"message","id":"a73a4457","parentId":"07aa8ddd","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:02:36.074Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 有，长久办法我建议你直接定一个，别再靠临时碰运气。\n\n## 最稳的长期方案：给我一个**长期可用的 GitHub 读取通道**\n\n### 方案 A：**gh CLI 登录态**（我最推荐）\n让这台机器上的 `gh` 长期登录 GitHub。这样我以后可以直接查：\n\n- PR comments\n- review comments\n- timeline\n- CI 状态\n- reviewer 意见\n- maintainer 回复\n\n你只要做一次：\n\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\n登录完成后，我以后就能直接跑类似：\n\n```bash\ngh pr view 58228 --repo openclaw/openclaw --comments\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58228/comments\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/58228/reviews\n```\n\n### 这个方案的优点\n- **最稳定**\n- 不依赖浏览器是否开着\n- 不依赖 remote debugging\n- 可自动化、可 cron、可持续巡检\n\n---\n\n## 方案 B：**长期可附着的已登录 Chrome**\n就是你刚才说的浏览器登录态方案，但把它变成长期可用：\n\n- Chrome 固定开着\n- 固定一个 GitHub 已登录 profile\n- 固定 remote debugging 端口 `9222`\n\n这样我可以用 browser 工具直接读页面。\n\n### 缺点\n- 比 `gh` 脆弱\n- 浏览器关了就断\n- 有时页面太复杂，抓评论不如 API 稳\n\n---\n\n## 方案 C：**GitHub PAT + API**\n给这台机器配置一个只读 token，我以后直接走 GitHub API。\n\n### 优点\n- 很稳\n- 适合自动化\n- 比浏览器更可靠\n\n### 缺点\n- 要管理 token\n- 你比较在意安全的话，不如 `gh auth login` 省心\n\n---\n\n# 我的建议（直接执行版）\n\n**你就做方案 A：`gh auth login`。**\n这是最适合长期工作的办法。\n\n## 为什么\n因为你要的是：\n- 我以后**自行查询页面反馈**\n- 不要每次都问你\n- 要能长期稳定跑\n\n那就别走浏览器这种临时方案，**直接把 `gh` 登录态配好**。\n\n---\n\n# 配好后我能长期做什么\n1. 自动检查我们提的 issue / PR 有没有新评论\n2. 自动看 review 里是不是机器人 / maintainer / 人类\n3. 自动提炼“别人到底说了什么”\n4. 自动汇报 merge / request changes / approve\n5. 配合 cron 做持续跟进\n\n---\n\n# 一句话结论\n**长久办法：给我 `gh` 的长期登录态。**\n这是最稳、最省事、最适合持续推进 OpenClaw 项目的方案。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd2563cc048191bf3ae25f33189829\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":731,"output":638,"cacheRead":150528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":151897,"cost":{"input":0.0018275000000000001,"output":0.00957,"cacheRead":0.037632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.049029500000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775052125467,"responseId":"resp_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd255e0540819195949c08df37b658"}}
