{"type":"message","id":"3d382a2c","parentId":"c49c1104","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:04:37.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，就走 **方案 A：`gh auth login`**。\n\n你现在在这台机器上执行一次：\n\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\n建议选：\n- **GitHub.com**\n- **HTTPS**\n- **Login with a web browser**\n\n登录完后，回我一句：**“好了”**\n\n我后面就能长期自己查：\n- PR 评论\n- review comments\n- maintainer 反馈\n- merge / CI / reviewer 状态\n\n以后这类页面反馈我就不再卡住。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd25ee4b0481919470bf77aa4e6ca8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":433,"output":120,"cacheRead":151808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":152361,"cost":{"input":0.0010825000000000001,"output":0.0018,"cacheRead":0.037952,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0408345}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775052261590,"responseId":"resp_0fdcdfb0edcfdacf0169cd25e636008191915d191610d946cd"}}
